# Size in bytes of the netstandard2.0 Release MoonSharp.Interpreter.dll as tools/size/size.sh
# builds it. CI (the size job in .github/workflows/ci.yml) warns when the DLL is more than
# 512 bytes larger or smaller than this number; size never fails CI.
